{"4506950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucky Duckies", "steam_appid": 4506950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the bathtub, where everything is bigger, bouncier, and bubblier than life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Lucky Duckies</strong>, you and your friend play as Dustin and Darlene, two parent rubber duckies trying to guide your duckling flock back to safety after a bubble bath goes wildly out of control. What should have been a peaceful soak turns into a whimsical adventure across shampoo bottles, spinning water wheels, and floating bubbles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/455d1a086ed5300c06877bcafab7312a.avif?t=1778009090\" width=780 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together locally or online as a pair of parent duckies! Cooperation is always the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/6a0f028f2157254564006dbbb7604e6e.poster.avif?t=1778009090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/6a0f028f2157254564006dbbb7604e6e.webm?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/6a0f028f2157254564006dbbb7604e6e.mp4?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/ab8e070972346271c3e60853458060f5.avif?t=1778009090\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide, protect, and wrangle a group of adorable ducklings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/47ede8f49b0d7237210f7583ef2c6cdc.poster.avif?t=1778009090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/47ede8f49b0d7237210f7583ef2c6cdc.webm?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/47ede8f49b0d7237210f7583ef2c6cdc.mp4?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/ba0a2a27ac65160c8bca9ef281096603.avif?t=1778009090\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve silly, bath-themed puzzles using bubbles, water, movement, and teamwork. Enjoy the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/67c34e0bfe992ef792a177f5b1a7474b.poster.avif?t=1778009090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/67c34e0bfe992ef792a177f5b1a7474b.webm?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/67c34e0bfe992ef792a177f5b1a7474b.mp4?t=1778009090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506950/extras/394cd3fe9b24eb